WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:03.340
A baker pours half a
cup of milk into a bowl.

2
00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:06.160
Then she adds a third of a cup more.

3
00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:11.300
A sticky note on the fridge reads: one
half plus one third equals two fifths of

4
00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:12.260
a cup.

5
00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:14.380
Add the tops, add the bottoms.

6
00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:15.570
It looks neat.

7
00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:17.400
But is the note right?

8
00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:20.610
In this mission, you'll
meet equivalent fractions:

9
00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:23.430
different-looking fractions
with the same value.

10
00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:27.330
You'll find fractions of amounts,
and work with mixed numbers.

11
00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:31.770
And you'll add, subtract,
multiply and divide fractions,

12
00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:33.880
all without a calculator.

13
00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:38.650
Your mission: decide whether half
a cup, then a third of a cup more,

14
00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:40.830
really makes two fifths of a cup.
